data automatically when you visit our website, including IP address, browser type, pages visited, and time spent on each page via cookies and analytics tools."}]]}],["$","section","2. How We Use Your Information",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-white font-display font-bold text-lg mb-2","children":"2. How We Use Your Information"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"We use the information collected to respond to inquiries, process job applications, send newsletters (only with your explicit consent), improve our website experience, and comply with legal obligations. We never sell your personal data to third parties."}]]}],["$","section","3. Cookies",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-white font-display font-bold text-lg mb-2","children":"3. Cookies"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"We use essential cookies for website functionality and analytics cookies (with your consent) to understand how visitors interact with our site. You can manage cookie preferences at any time via our Cookie Settings page or your browser settings."}]]}],["$","section","4. Data Sharing",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-white font-display font-bold text-lg mb-2","children":"4. Data Sharing"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"We may share your data with trusted service providers (e.g., email platforms, cloud hosting) who process data on our behalf under strict data processing agreements. We do not share your data with advertisers or unrelated third parties."}]]}],["$","section","5. Data Retention",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-white font-display font-bold text-lg mb-2","children":"5. Data Retention"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"We retain your personal data only as long as necessary for the purpose it was collected. Contact inquiries are retained for 24 months. Newsletter subscribers' data is retained until you unsubscribe. Job application data is kept for 12 months."}]]}],["$","section","6. Your Rights (GDPR / CCPA)",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-white font-display font-bold text-lg mb-2","children":"6. Your Rights (GDPR / CCPA)"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"Depending on your jurisdiction, you have rights including: access to your data, rectification of inaccurate data, erasure ('right to be forgotten'), restriction of processing, data portability, and the right to object. To exercise these rights, email us at privacy@rainbow.agency."}]]}],["$","section","7. Security",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-white font-display font-bold text-lg mb-2","children":"7. Security"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"We implement industry-standard security measures including TLS encryption in transit, AES-256 encryption at rest, and regular security audits. No method of transmission over the Internet is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security."}]]}],["$","section","8. Third-Party Links",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-white font-display font-bold text-lg mb-2","children":"8. Third-Party Links"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"Our website may contain links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for their privacy practices and encourage you to review their privacy policies."}]]}],["$","section","9. Children's Privacy",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-white font-display font-bold text-lg mb-2","children":"9. Children's Privacy"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"Our services are not directed to children under 16. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe we have inadvertently collected such data, please contact us immediately."}]]}],["$","section","10. Changes to This Policy",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-white font-display font-bold text-lg mb-2","children":"10. Changes to This Policy"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. We will notify you of material changes by updating the date at the top of this page and, where appropriate, sending an email notification."}]]}],["$","section","11. Contact Us",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-white font-display font-bold text-lg mb-2","children":"11. Contact Us"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"For privacy-related questions or requests: Rainbow Agency Inc., privacy@rainbow.agency. We aim to respond to all requests within 30 days."}]]}]]}]]}]}],null,["$","$L5",null,{"children":["$L6","$L7",["$","$L8",null,{"promise":"$@9"}]]}]]}],{},null,false]},null,false]},null,false]},null,false],["$","$1","h",{"children":[null,["$","$1","5PruhWA3oLl1wsbW5HNsfv",{"children":[["$","$La",null,{"children":"$Lb"}],null]}],["$","$Lc",null,{"children":"$Ld"}]]}],false]],"m":"$undefined","G":["$e","$undefined"],"s":false,"S":true}
